{
  "schema": "elysium.research.frida.recipe.v1",
  "name": "life_katana_oceanhouse",
  "description": "One piloted minute on sm_oceanhouse_1, Malkavian male armor 3 wielding item_w_katana, third person. Every pinned animation target except the four that carry no decision state: client.decode_bone_position, client.decode_bone_quaternion and client.decode_selected_bones fire per bone per model per frame and would consume the trace with decoder noise, and client.get_studio_hdr is a pure accessor. Records the server-side melee selection chain with its verified CBasePlayer displacements, and the client-side pose state per model per frame: identity, MOVETYPE, the follow handle, sequence/cycle/playback rate and the pose-parameter array, plus client.resolve_follow_parent whose return value is the wield model's attach answer. engine.model_render_draw_model and studiorender.draw_model are excluded on measured rate: a 3 s rehearsal on the live process recorded 253,000/min and 93,000/min, 92% of all events, for render submission that carries no animation state.",
